-- Simple-English terminology redo (2026-07-31) — fixes reverted terminology
-- and applies a simpler-English standard for ui_strings across the 9 core
-- surfaces (Factory 360, Planning, Visits/Field Execution, Submission/
-- Reports, Review & Approval, Operations Center, Compliance/Enforcement
-- admin pages, Admin Config, Shell/Nav). Guarded upsert: never clobbers a
-- human-reviewed translation (status='draft' only).
on conflict (key) do update
  set ar = excluded.ar, en = excluded.en, context = excluded.context
  where ui_strings.status = 'draft';
